    "title": "Special Weather Statement by NWS - NewsBreak",
    "text": "9 minutes ago Check NWS updates here\nEffective: 2025-11-19 23:22:00 CST Expires: 2025-11-19 23:45:00 CST Urgency: Expected Severity: Moderate Certainty: Observed Instruction: If outdoors, consider seeking shelter inside a building. Target Area: Barry At 1121 PM CST, Doppler radar was tracking a strong thunderstorm 11 miles east of Cassville, moving northeast at 20 mph.\nHAZARD...Penny size hail.\nSOURCE...Radar indicated.\nIMPACT...Minor hail damage to vegetation is possible.\nThis storm will remain over mainly rural areas of east central Barry County.",
